81a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈元珍赴沙县二尹陈曾预史局书写三首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"章程自是子谙知，民社如今亦有之。\n莫谓哦松堪了职，好将勤慎答明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37593,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈元珍赴沙县二尹陈曾预史局书写三首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"慈云冉冉荫虚亭，小有寒泉彻底清。\n不用老僧他作供，秖须一勺洗中扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37594,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香山来青轩","author":"孙承恩","text":"矗矗群峰列画屏，四时空翠落檐楹。\n青山与我皆无意，那得机心管送迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37595,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞口","author":"孙承恩","text":"洞口时时护白云，莫教容易入红尘。\n更须检点桃花片，流出溪前惹世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37596,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次张阳峰壁间韵","author":"孙承恩","text":"白日流云走石沙，诸天隐隐落空花。\n一尘不到清虚境，羡尔山中老衲家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37597,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱文石太史奉使襄藩四首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"汉水天潢引派长，古今形胜说襄阳。\n皇恩浩荡乾坤大，龙诰辉煌日月光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37598,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱文石太史奉使襄藩四首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"宝册金章降圣朝，岘山襄水郁岧峣。\n襄江浪偃迎龙节，岘首云开接使轺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37599,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱文石太史奉使襄藩四首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"武侯人物更谁同，千载南阳说卧龙。\n今日子行须大手，再镌休烈重祠中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37600,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱文石太史奉使襄藩四首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"羊公碑石藓痕多，遗爱应无迹渐磨。\n子行试剔荒苔看，尚有行人堕泪么。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37601,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"潜江田子有时闻，为政都非俗吏伦。\n勤职岂惟精讼牒，爱贤时复访衡门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37602,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其二","author":"孙承恩","text":"田侯德政著淮阴，父老遗祠感慕深。\n试看淮上今时月，曾照田侯往日心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37603,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其三","author":"孙承恩","text":"田君才识下僚淹，龌龊从教俗吏嫌。\n都来民瘼谁胜任，尽付君家一力担。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37604,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其四","author":"孙承恩","text":"谁能为政似田侯，奏最曾闻荷眷褒。\n今日徵书腾宠异，先教恩命贲林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37605,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其五","author":"孙承恩","text":"恭承新命拜恩荣，行色秋高白帝城。\n舒江浪偃迎官舫，巫峡云开见使旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37606,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠潜江田侯赴夔州别驾六首 其六","author":"孙承恩","text":"宦绩从来盛蜀中，前有文翁后了翁。\n寻常俗吏非君事，政教须当继古风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37607,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"孙承恩","text":"木落天空水作秋，怀人离思正悠悠。\n閒来携取君山笛，吹出乾坤万古愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37608,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中偶作","author":"孙承恩","text":"一奉天书别故园，白云迟我几时还。\n欲知宦兴今何似，试把连朝面貌看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37609,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮河舟中送乡人南还","author":"孙承恩","text":"淮流渺渺水增波，迢递趋朝别思多。\n送尔南归还羡尔，丹阳郭里听吴歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37610,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中有怀张石川","author":"孙承恩","text":"江心话别意匆匆，舵转杯停酒未终。\n忽漫去帆看不见，斜风细雨独推篷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37611,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下宝应湖舟行","author":"孙承恩","text":"湖上凉风向晚生，扁舟遥溯月华明。\n人家鸡犬无鸣吠，一路嘈嘈络纬声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37612,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送月空上人四首 其一","author":"孙承恩","text":"一杖横空铁骑飞，海滨掊杀几倭夷。\n幻看身世心如铁，此是禅家第一机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":37613,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]